OL,3,GNEWSA'Burnham bounce' sees Labour win
OL,4,Aby-election seat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 'Burnham bounce' has given Labour a
OL,7,Fbig by-election win in the Prime
OL,8,FMinister's constituency in Wigan.
OL,10,FJohn Vickers triumphed in the Hindley
OL,11,FGreen by-election, held following the
OL,12,Fdeath of long-standing member Bob
OL,13,FBrierley.
OL,15,FHe topped the polls with 1,201 votes
OL,16,Fand Reform's Bonnie Clarke was second
OL,17,Fwith 887 votes.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
