OL,3,GNEWSA'Burnham bounce' sees Labour win
OL,4,Aby-election seat
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt marked the first Wigan borough
OL,7,Felection won by Labour this year, after
OL,8,Fthey suffered a "wipe-out" in all 25
OL,9,Fcontested seats for the council in
OL,10,FMay's local elections.
